This repository is agent-native. It uses `AGENTS.md` as the canonical, always-on
instruction set and `.agents/` as the version-controlled home for skills, references,
shared memory, handoffs, and (optionally) role charters and worktree helpers.

## Quick start
- Read `AGENTS.md` first — it defines the operating rules.
- Review `.agents/memory/current-status.md` and `.agents/memory/decisions.md`.
- See `.agents/references/` for architecture and conventions.

## Structure
- `AGENTS.md` — primary always-on agent instructions.
- `CLAUDE.md` — thin bridge importing `AGENTS.md`.
- `.agents/` — skills, references, memory, handoffs, agents, worktrees, volley.
- `docs/` — long-form human + agent documentation.

## Updating
This project was generated with [Copier](https://copier.readthedocs.io/). To pull in
upstream template changes without destroying local customizations:

```
copier update
```

See `docs/design-rationale.md` in the template for the reasoning behind this structure.
